@baseUrl=http://localhost:9005

### chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Hello!"
}

### chat stream
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Hello!",
  "conversationId": "001"
}

### stream longer response
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "Introduce the technique of Graph API",
  "conversationId": "001"
}
